  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Due to changes in Fedora the old javascript based HTML UI is showing it’s age. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "attrs": {
        "url": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3897"
       },
       "type": "inlineCard"
      },
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "attrs": {
        "url": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3894"
       },
       "type": "inlineCard"
      },
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This ticket is to consider an external user interface that makes use of Fedora’s API and allows for a richer user experience.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This UI could also integrate with the OAI-PMH functionality ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "attrs": {
        "url": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3884"
       },
       "type": "inlineCard"
      },
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This ticket is to start to scope out an initial set of functionality and the framework to build it in.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
