  "description": "<p>Due to changes in Fedora the old javascript based HTML UI is showing it’s age. </p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3897\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3897</a> </p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3894\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3894</a> </p>\n\n<p>This ticket is to consider an external user interface that makes use of Fedora’s API and allows for a richer user experience.</p>\n\n<p>This UI could also integrate with the OAI-PMH functionality <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3884\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3884</a> </p>\n\n<p>This ticket is to start to scope out an initial set of functionality and the framework to build it in.</p>",
